# Database exports, dumps and env captures: member data, live subscription
# tokens, the account pepper. The deployer image copies the whole context, so a
# stray one in the checkout would be baked into it. docs/beta-deploy.md writes
# them outside the checkout; these catch one left behind anyway. `**/` because
# a bare pattern here only matches at the context root.
